msgctxt "80"
msgid "Man, you're strong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Sorry, but I won't be cold or lifeless anytime soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Son of a bitch..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "You're right. I have been watching from a distance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "You're Ibuki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "But I'm doing my best to fight you guys in my own way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"And I believe that someday, you'll come to understand us\r\n"
"better..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"But for now, I hope you'll give me a few minutes of your\r\n"
"time and listen to what I have to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Aw, son of a bitch..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Thank you, Kiryu-san. I'll take it from here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"That's the hitman Sentetsu. I've heard he's a hot-blooded\r\n"
"guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "I'll go check him out. Don't come out until it's over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Ibuki of the HLA! Get your ass out here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "What do you want with the HLA?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Are you Ibuki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"No, but if you've got business with the HLA, you can hash\r\n"
"it out with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "This has nothing to do with you. Get Ibuki the fuck out here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "What do you want with Ibuki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I heard he hired some tough guy who's been after our men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"The cowardly little bitch, watchin' from a distance like\r\n"
"that! Figured I come beat his ass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "What if I told you I was the guy he hired?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Oh, really, now!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Yeah, really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "That makes it easier, then! I'll just kill you instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"As soon as I hand Ibuki your cold, lifeless body, he'll know\r\n"
"not to meddle in our affairs ever again!"
msgstr ""

